No longer here
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The engine once carried entries for TradingView Lightweight Charts, xterm.js
and its fit addon, and the Monaco Editor with web-tree-sitter and
tree-sitter-python. All were vendored assets of a front end this repository no
longer holds: there is no `public/vendor` here, and nothing in the tree
references them. They are named here rather than deleted silently, because a
notice that quietly loses an entry is indistinguishable from one that never
had it, and a reader comparing an older archive against this one should be
able to tell which happened.
